---
// The twin Dragon's Horns as a clickable illustration — each tower is its own area.
---

<div class="towermap">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 800 300"
    role="img"
    aria-label="The twin Dragon's Horns. The left tower and the right tower are separate climbing areas."
  >
    <rect class="tm-sky" x="0" y="0" width="800" height="300"></rect>
    <path
      class="tm-massif-2"
      d="M0 250 L120 232 L220 200 L300 150 L370 190 L440 150 L520 96 L580 130 L680 190 L800 224 L800 300 L0 300 Z"
    ></path>
    <path
      class="tm-massif"
      d="M110 260 L150 222 L182 168 L212 96 L238 40 L250 26 L268 62 L296 150 L326 200 L356 240 L380 224 L410 168 L448 104 L482 60 L500 40 L520 78 L548 150 L580 210 L622 250 L680 280 L720 292 L720 300 L110 300 Z"
    ></path>
    <path
      class="tm-canopy"
      d="M0 278 C 120 262, 200 282, 280 272 C 380 258, 440 286, 520 274 C 620 262, 680 288, 800 276 L800 300 L0 300 Z"
    ></path>
    <path class="tm-line" style="--len:250" d="M235 262 C 230 210, 240 160, 246 118 C 250 84, 244 48, 250 28"
    ></path>
    <path class="tm-line b" style="--len:230" d="M500 250 C 498 208, 490 150, 500 90 C 504 66, 500 50, 500 40"
    ></path>
    <text class="tm-tag" x="150" y="278">SOUTH TOWER</text>
    <text class="tm-tag" x="470" y="278">NORTH TOWER</text>
    <a href="/areas/south-tower" aria-label="South Tower — 10 routes">
      <path class="tm-hit" d="M100 300 L150 222 L212 96 L250 26 L296 150 L356 240 L380 260 L380 300 Z"></path>
    </a>
    <a href="/areas/north-tower" aria-label="North Tower — one route and a via ferrata">
      <path class="tm-hit" d="M400 300 L410 168 L482 60 L500 40 L548 150 L622 250 L660 290 L660 300 Z"></path>
    </a>
  </svg>
  <p class="tm-cap">
    Two fangs of one mountain, Gunung Nenek Semukut — and two separate areas. The
    <strong>North Tower</strong> also has a <strong>via ferrata</strong> for non-climbers.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .towermap {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .towermap svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .tm-sky {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, var(--surface));
  }
  .tm-massif {
    fill: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .tm-massif-2 {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-2) 55%, var(--surface));
  }
  .tm-canopy {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mid) 20%, var(--surface));
  }
  .tm-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--oxide);
    stroke-width: 2.2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    pointer-events: none;
    stroke-dasharray: var(--len);
    stroke-dashoffset: var(--len);
    animation: draw 1.7s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0.02, 0.28, 1) forwards;
  }
  .tm-line.b {
    animation-delay: 0.5s;
  }
  .tm-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--mid);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .tm-hit {
    fill: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: fill 0.2s;
  }
  a:hover .tm-hit,
  a:focus-visible .tm-hit {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 12%, transparent);
    outline: none;
  }
  .tm-cap {
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--mid);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  @keyframes draw {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .tm-line {
      animation: none;
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
